{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/绝命毒针•改","pageid":8182,"revid":20177,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%BB%9D%E5%91%BD%E6%AF%92%E9%92%88%E2%80%A2%E6%94%B9&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%BB%9D%E5%91%BD%E6%AF%92%E9%92%88%E2%80%A2%E6%94%B9&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%BB%9D%E5%91%BD%E6%AF%92%E9%92%88%E2%80%A2%E6%94%B9&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>绝命毒针•改</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.BB.9D.E5.91.BD.E6.AF.92.E9.92.88.E2.80.A2.E6.94.B9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"绝命毒针•改\"><b>绝命毒针•改</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 风神箭•疾风破.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/1c/p40t7nunr4qfzshskpq5gedtlo5ze5k.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%A3%8E%E7%A5%9E%E7%AE%AD%E2%80%A2%E7%96%BE%E9%A3%8E%E7%A0%B4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/1c/p40t7nunr4qfzshskpq5gedtlo5ze5k.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%A3%8E%E7%A5%9E%E7%AE%AD%E2%80%A2%E7%96%BE%E9%A3%8E%E7%A0%B4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1c/p40t7nunr4qfzshskpq5gedtlo5ze5k.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />绝命毒针•改\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）对场上物防最低的敌人进行标记，施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×反应技\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×反应技</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦下次行动开始时，移动至目标周围，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">120%</font>物攻值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]（若无法抵达，则改为攻击其他目标）。<br />✦攻击后，若目标生命值低于<font color=\"#ed7950\">60%</font>，则触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"抹煞\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">抹煞</font></span></span>]。<br />✦攻击前每移动<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，最多<font color=\"#ed7950\">100%</font>。<br />拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">强袭时刻</font></span>]，效果：若使用[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">绝命毒针•改</span>]时，移动大于等于<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>步，则对场上所有敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>生命值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]，并施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"霜冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">霜冻</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/84/lekhjouylcdedt30jvnh0upev2fjg1n.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/84/lekhjouylcdedt30jvnh0upev2fjg1n.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E8%99%AB%E5%B7%A2%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%9B\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/灾翼虫巢暴君\"><img alt=\"灾翼虫巢暴君 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/83/64pmeax0dwh618618ahxrsoumr7sgvs.png/75px-%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E8%99%AB%E5%B7%A2%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%9B_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/83/64pmeax0dwh618618ahxrsoumr7sgvs.png/113px-%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E8%99%AB%E5%B7%A2%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%9B_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/83/64pmeax0dwh618618ahxrsoumr7sgvs.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n</div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261021205538\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.440 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.586 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9891/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 169981/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 17842/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  561.298      1 模板:技能\n100.00%  561.298      1 -total\n 10